error[B0406]: `n` is `inout`, and an `async` function takes none
 --> check/inout_args.bloom:5:14
  |
5 | func later(_ n: inout Int) async { n = 2 }
  |              ^ `inout` in an `async` function
  |
help: return the new value instead, and assign it where it is called
  = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#5-values-functions-and-closures

error[B0406]: `n` is `inout`: pass a `var`'s place with `&`
  --> check/inout_args.bloom:10:8
   |
10 |   bump(n)
   |        ^ written back when the call returns
   |
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#5-values-functions-and-closures

error[B0403]: cannot pass `k` as `inout`: it is immutable
  --> check/inout_args.bloom:11:9
   |
 9 |   let k = 2
   |       - declared here
   |
11 |   bump(&k)
   |         ^ immutable
   |
help: declare it with `var k = …` (in a function) or make it `@state k = …` (in a view)
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules

error[B0406]: `&` passes a place to an `inout` parameter, and this is none
  --> check/inout_args.bloom:12:11
   |
12 |   let m = &n
   |           ^^ not an `inout` parameter's argument
   |
help: pass the value itself, without `&`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#5-values-functions-and-closures

error[B0201]: expected `Float`, found `Int`
  --> check/inout_args.bloom:13:10
   |
13 |   widen(&n)
   |          ^ this is `Int`
   |
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules

error[B0403]: an `inout` argument is a `var`'s place
  --> check/inout_args.bloom:14:9
   |
14 |   bump(&5)
   |         ^ not a `var`
   |
help: copy it into a `var` first: `var next = …`, then pass `&next`
   = docs: https://github.com/OxyHQ/Bloom/blob/main/docs/bloom-lang-spec.mdx#43-soundness-rules
